%% DM26-0670

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Connecting: start, unacknowledged entries loaded from the file
    Connecting --> Online: Connected, subscriptions sent, outbox retransmitted
    Online --> Offline: ConnectionLost, outbox written to the file
    Offline --> Connecting: backoff elapsed, transport respawned
    Online --> Draining: ProceedWithShutdown, publishes now refused
    Offline --> Draining: ProceedWithShutdown, publishes now refused
    Draining --> [*]: outbox empty or the budget is spent, the remainder written to the file

    note left of Online
        Domain actors may publish while they drain,
        so publishing stays open until they have finished
        and ProceedWithShutdown arrives.
    end note

    note right of Offline
        Every publish goes into the outbox
        and is appended to the file.
        Nothing is dropped, nothing is sent.
    end note
